Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 15:45:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 52/64] P3: per-weapon ADS iron-sight bake and tune tooling.

Absolute cg_codAdsView rows from the in-game SAVE log, zero global iron-sight offsets, keep Start/Next/Save plus crosshair-force for later re-tune, and show hip crosshair on Garand/Mauser.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
